{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkw1qGBwSGWAGVgEcMyT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd put the study fund at about 66 thousand after 5 years, and I can take it out tax-free after 6. I'm fairly sure about the 6 years. The money figure is shakier.\n\n**What decided it:** the first lines of the page, \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך את הכסף בלי מס הכנסה\". The chart says the same thing: \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" on the left and \"מ־6 שנים: פטור ממס\" on the right.\n\n**How much:** the calculator's example puts in 300 ₪ a month from me and 900 ₪ from the employer. If I take it out after 5 years, the last bar, \"נשאר בידיים\", shows \"66,5…\". The rest of that number is hidden under the round arrow button. Next to it is a red \"−13,974\", which is the tax. So waiting one more year saves that 14k, and bars 6 to 12 just keep going up. My pay is lower than theirs, so mine would be a bit less, but it's roughly that.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. The top: \"קרן השתלמות\", the subtitle, and the \"מה זה\" paragraph with the 6 years / 3 years part.\n2. I skipped past the bit about how much is tax-free (15,712 ₪, 20,566 ₪) and the round buttons (\"קופת גמל להשקעה\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתית צמודה\" and the others).\n3. The calculator, \"כמה כסף נשאר לכם, ומתי?\": 2.5% from me, 7.5% from the employer, 7% return, 0.54% fees. It was set to \"מושכים את הכסף אחרי 5 שנים\". I didn't move the marker; I just looked at the bars.\n4. The text under it, \"משיכה אחרי 5 שנים…\", which I only half read.\n5. Scrolled past \"שווה לדעת\", \"מי מציע ומי מצטרף\" and \"משיכה ומעבר\", reading only the headings. I stopped at \"כמה זה עולה\" and didn't look at the screens after it.\n\n**What I didn't get:**\n- \"לחשבון נכנסים קודם 50,719 ₪, והקרן מעבירה 29,768 ₪ למס הכנסה… 15,794 ₪ מהם חוזרים\". Is it 50k or 66k? And 29k to tax, 14k to tax or 15k back? I gave up on it and went with the bar.\n- I didn't understand \"קופת גמל\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתית צמודה / לא צמודה\", \"מזומן שקלי\", \"כל הסכומים בכסף של היום\", \"KH-19\" or \"חוקים וכלליים · 10\".\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- The big final number is cut off under the arrow button.\n- The calculator opens at 5 years, exactly when there's tax, and not at 6.\n- I couldn't tell which colour in the bars is my money and which is the employer's. My guess: yellow is the employer, grey is me, and the green top is the return. The red striped bit is clearly the tax, though, and it's scary.\n- The calculator's settings at the top were cut off between screens, so I never saw what salary it used. I'm guessing it's 12,000.\n\nI'd stop reading at \"כמה זה עולה\". I got what I came for."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1861,"cache_read_input_tokens":15895,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1861},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4f13f50-c139-4c20-b66c-59e2ba1dd50f","uuid":"b9f8ced2-6ea1-4c1b-b6d8-b559f2d4857c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:03:58.585Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkw1q3YAz9UZVsGSUkdG"}
